OL,3,GNEWSAWar memorial plaques returned to
OL,4,AEuston station
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo memorial plaques honouring railway
OL,7,Fworkers who served during the World
OL,8,FWars have been returned to Euston
OL,9,Fstation in time for Armistice Day.
OL,11,FThe plaques have been installed on
OL,12,FEuston's main concourse, ahead of an
OL,13,Fannual Armistice service at the station
OL,14,Flater on Wednesday.
OL,16,FThey honour 24 railway workers
OL,17,Fconnected with the station and railway
OL,18,Fnetwork - 19 people from World War One
OL,19,Fand five from World War Two. Station
OL,20,Fmanager Tom Barry said it was
OL,21,F"incredibly special" to display the
OL,22,Fplaques publicly.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
